      "detailed_description": "This is a story about a girl saving her sister. Her sister Mu Deng has contracted a terrible &quot;Dreamless Syndrome.&quot; The beautiful researcher &quot;ZZ&quot; resolutely pilots an experimental machine to carry out the &quot;Dream Break&quot; mission—<br><br>Flying enemies continuously shoot bullets at you. You need to pilot the &quot;Dream Breaker&quot; to [graze bullets] and accumulate energy, then release the [Phantasm Skill] to clear the field at the right time. After clearing, the phantasm particles you collect can be used to upgrade your machine or change skins.<br><br>Scatter, Tunneling, Forcing, Reading... The backlash from memory projection causes her to mentally collapse. Who is the girl-shaped boss that appears deep in the dream?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/d58db7e2ff868ef909e105610918e646.avif?t=1769181852\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/122a5bacd2df71de13d723c41498ea8f.poster.avif?t=1769181852\" width=650 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/122a5bacd2df71de13d723c41498ea8f.webm?t=1769181852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Step into the school life of the silent middle schooler &quot;Mu Deng,&quot; after encounters, bullying, and betrayal, what follows is despair, or perhaps...?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242840/extras/2635bfdf6bbca1814e940583cb152a2e.avif?t=1769181852\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s